 "_description": "Ranking reward tables -> server/data/ranking_rewards.json (roadmap Ö1; server: rankings.py).\n\nThe client's flow: the mode's window receives the reward ranges together with the ranking info (PlutusInfoCommand.playerRanges,\nEternalBlacklightRankingEventInfoCommand / RogueLiteRankEventInfoCommand.playerRankRanges: RankRewardRangeModule {from, to}); the reward\ntab sends RankRewardRequest {ranking: start of the range, rankType} for each range; the response is RankRewardCommand {rankType,\nrewardContentModuleList [RewardModule {lootId, amount} | RewardTitleModule {titleKey}], rewardRange}. rankType is the client's RankType:\n2 Gauntlet of Plutus, 7 Eternal Black Light, 9 Astral Ascension (Rogue-Lite).\n\nSources:\n  2  belgeler/wiki/etkinlikler/gauntlet_of_plutus.json \"ranking\" (tiers of the wiki event page, text)\n  7  belgeler/wiki/pve_modlari/eternal_black_light.json ebl.ranking.reward_sets[0] (2020 table; later sets with the same amounts,\n     without P.E.T. designs); the title is from the latest set (September 2026, \"Eternal King\")\n  9  server/data/responses.json: the recording's RankRewardCommands (October 2026 Astral set)\nIn single-player only the player is in the ranking: the tables are visible in the window; distribution with bot players (Phase 11).",
